      "stealth": {
        "value": 12,
        "details": "<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-primary); font-size: var(--font-size-14);\">@Check[type:perception|dc:20|name:To her a child sobbing|traits:complex,haunt,hazard] (trained)</span><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-primary); font-size: var(--font-size-14);\">&nbsp;</span>to To her a child sobbing.</li>\n</ul>"
      },
      "emitsSound": "encounter",
      "hasHealth": true
    },
    "details": {
      "isComplex": true,
      "level": {
        "value": 3
      },
      "disable": "<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-primary); font-size: var(--font-size-14);\">@Check[type:diplomacy|dc:20|name:To comfort the Child|traits:complex,haunt,hazard] (trained)</span><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-primary); font-size: var(--font-size-14);\">&nbsp;</span>To comfort the Child</li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-primary); font-size: var(--font-size-14);\">@Check[type:religion|dc:18|name:To soothe the Spirit|traits:complex,haunt,hazard] (expert)</span><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-primary); font-size: var(--font-size-14);\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-primary); font-size: var(--font-size-14);\">To soothe&nbsp;the Spirit</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-primary); font-size: var(--font-size-14);\">@Check[type:occultism|dc:19|name:To soothe the Spirit|traits:complex,haunt,hazard] (expert)</span><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-primary); font-size: var(--font-size-14);\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-primary); font-size: var(--font-size-14);\">To soothe&nbsp;the Spirit</span></li>\n</ul>",
      "description": "<p><strong>Obsessed Haunt</strong>: This Haunt affects the target of Aldern Foxgloves obsession which attracts Vorel Foxgloves obsession with eternal life. <span style=\"font-family:var(--font-primary);font-size:var(--font-size-14)\">If no creatures in a group are haunted by Alderns obsession this haunt may target any creature.</span></p>",
      "reset": "<p>This Haunt automatially resets after one day until the supernatural Fungus in B37 is dealt with, even if the haunt was previously disabled.</p>",
      "routine": "<p><strong>\"They are coming for me\" Trigger </strong>Haunted creature gets near bed.&nbsp;<span style=\"font-family: var(--font-primary); font-size: var(--font-size-14);\">The haunted character suddenly becomes convinced that his parents are trying to kill each other, and that whichever of them survives will be coming to kill him next; he has a vision of his mother, wielding a torch, and his father, festering with tumors and wielding a long knife, both struggling to kill each other.&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p>Creature must make a @Check[type:will|dc:23|traits:mental,incapacitating,linguistic,necromancy,occult] save to avoid effect) save.</p>\n<hr style=\"border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border-light-primary); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border-light-highlight);\" />\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Critical Success</strong> The target is unaffected.</li>\n<li><strong>Success</strong> Creature is @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.e1XGnhKNSQIm5IXg]{Stupefied}.</li>\n<li><strong>Failure</strong> Creature is @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.e1XGnhKNSQIm5IXg]{Stupefied 2}.</li>\n<li><strong>Critical Failure</strong> Creature is @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.e1XGnhKNSQIm5IXg]{Stupefied 3}.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"text-align: justify;\">This stupeﬁed condition reduces by 1 after a full night&rsquo;s rest.</span></p>"
    },
